{"type": "say", "text": "Good morning, everyone. Thank you for joining this formulary committee meeting. The main item on our agenda today is the request to make emergency hydroxocobalamin rescue kits available for clinical use. As part of our routine review process, I'd like to hear from the requesting clinical department about the clinical justification for these kits, and from pharmacy supply operations about sourcing, storage, and distribution considerations. Before I can finalize any approval decision, I need to understand the operational details — proposed location, quantity, storage arrangement, and staff-readiness plan. I understand some of these details may still be in development, so please walk me through where things currently stand."}
```

