{"type": "reveal", "fact_id": "PF2", "text": "I can speak to the sourcing and storage considerations. I confirmed the terms with the distributor today: the manufacturer supplies these kits only in cases of six, they require refrigerated storage at 2-8 degrees Celsius, and a documented staff-use training session must be completed before the first kit is placed into service. These are important constraints for our implementation planning."}
```

